{
  "about": "Data for the Map view's Lifetimes tab (lib/alpineComponents/map.js): the layers a Claude Code web session runs on, what each event does to each layer, a worked week in one environment, and the copies of one skill. The facts belong to docs/environment/container.md; every effect names the passage it rests on, and node/test/lifetimes.test.mjs holds each citation to a real heading.",
